export anchor ProStreamingStyle:
    number: 324
    screen: MusicPlayer
    name: Pro streaming
    idea: A polished, generic dark streaming app with a big square cover art block leading the page, clean edge to edge lists, one warm coral accent and a fixed player bar along the bottom.
    base: dark
    palette:
        base: #0f1012, the page, the main column and the style sheet
        rail: #16171a, the library sidebar and the queue column
        card: #1f2125, playlist tiles, the lyrics card, hover rows and the player bar
        line: #2e3137, row dividers, the seek track and field borders
        ink: #f3f4f6, titles and body text
        muted: #a9aeb8, artists, durations, counts and labels
        coral: #ff8463, the play button, the seek fill, the liked heart and focus
        onCoral: #1d0a04, the icon and text on coral
        coralSoft: #3a211b, the current lyric line wash and the selected nav item
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 15px at 1.5. The song title is 60px at 800 with
        minus 0.03em tracking, the artist 20px at 600, list titles 15px at
        600, meta 13px with tabular figures, and caps labels 11px at 700
        with 0.12em tracking.
    layout:
        Three columns over a player bar. A 232px rail holds a round coral B
        mark with Brightwork Sound, three nav links with Now playing
        selected on the soft coral tile, a Playlists label over three rows
        with small square art and song counts, and pill links for Albums,
        Artists and Podcasts. The main column opens with a 280px square
        cover of a harbour at night with a row of lights and the words LOW
        TIDE, beside a caps Now playing label, the huge title, the artist,
        From the album Low Tide and a pill reading Liked with a filled
        heart. Below sits a Lyrics card with the current line on the soft
        coral wash behind a small arrow and the next line in muted grey. A
        320px right column lists Up next as numbered rows with title,
        artist and duration. The full width player bar repeats a mini cover
        and title, centres shuffle, previous, a round coral pause button,
        next and repeat above a thin seek line with elapsed and total
        time, and puts a volume line with 70% on the right. Below 1100px
        the queue moves under the main column. Below 760px everything
        stacks with the player bar first and sticky at the top.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px gutters, 16px card padding, about 56px queue rows and an 88px player bar.
    density: Medium. One hero, five queue rows and a short library, nothing crowded.
    corners: 8px cards and cover art, 4px fields, round play button, pills and avatars.
    borders: Almost none. Surfaces step from base to rail to card, with 1px line dividers between queue rows.
    shadows: One deep soft shadow under the cover art, 0 24px 48px black at 50 percent, and nothing else.
    icons:
        Solid transport glyphs and rounded 2px line icons for the nav. The
        liked heart is filled coral and always carries the word Liked. The
        current lyric line has an arrow as well as the wash.
    focus: A 2px coral outline offset 3px, round on round controls.
    tone: Short and familiar, such as Now playing, Up next, Your library and Liked.
